  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0480.adelon_dramaton.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0480.adelon_dramaton.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0480.adelon_dramaton.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0480_adelon_dramaton"><head>ΑΔΗΛΩΝ ΔΡΑΜΑΤΩΝ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="8" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-8" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0480_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-8-l1" xml:lang="grc">δαρθείς</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">ἀντὶ τοῦ δαρείς. Νικόχαρις Κενταύρῳ. Bekker. Anecd. 89, 5.</note>
            </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="15" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-15" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0480_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-15-l1" xml:lang="grc">εἰς αὔριον δ’ ἀντὶ ῥαφάνων ἑψήσομεν</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-15-l2" xml:lang="grc">βαλάνιον, ἵνα νῶν ἐξάγῃ τὴν κραιπάλην.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 1, 34d ὅτι δὲ τὴν κράμβην ῥάφανον ἐκάλουν οἱ παλαιοὶ δηλοῖ . . . Νικοχάρης κτλ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">1. δ’ add. Schweighaeuser. 2. βαλάνιον B et cod. Casauboni] βαλανεῖον. ἵνα νῶν L] ἵν’ οὖν V. ἐξάγῃ Dindorfius] ἐξάρῃ. Plin. N. h. 23, 145 aiunt quinis (amygdalae amarae) nucibus fere praesumtis ebrietatem non sentire potores.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="16" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-16" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0480_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-16-l1" xml:lang="grc">εἰ πεύσομαι τὸν ἀηδόνειον</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-16-l2" xml:lang="grc">ὕπνον ἀποδαρθόντ’, αὐτὸς αὑτὸν αἰτιῶ.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Bekker. Anecd. 349, 8 ἀηδόνειος ὕπνος· Νικόχαρις κτλ. sic</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="17" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-17" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0480_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-17-l1" xml:lang="grc">κύουσαν δέλφακα</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">θηλυκῶς Νικοχάρης ἔφη. Athenaeus 14, 657 a.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="18" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-18" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0480_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-18-l1" xml:lang="grc">τὴν ἀλάστορα Σφίγγα</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Bekker. Anecd. 382, 27 <foreign xml:lang="grc">ἀλάστωρ· θηλυκῶς Νικόχαρις κτλ.</foreign>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="19" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-19" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0480_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-19-l1" xml:lang="grc">ἄζειν</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">τὸ διὰ τοῦ στόματος ἀθρόως ἐκπνεῖν λέγουσιν Ἀττικοί, μιμούμενοι τὸν ἦχον τοῦ πνεύματος. οὕτω Νικόχαρις. Bekker. Anecd. 348, 18.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="20" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-20" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0480_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-20-l1" xml:lang="grc">ἀνηλεήμων</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Νικόχαρις λέγει. Bekker. Anecd. 400, 30. Dorvill. Charit. 724. Schaefer. Gregor. Cor. 163.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="21" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-21" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0480_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0480-adelon_dramaton-21-l1" xml:lang="grc">ὁ παιδαριώδης</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">παρὰ Νικοχάρει. Pollux 2, 19.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>
